{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35642","headline":"阴地关崇徽公主手迹 · 李山甫","name":"阴地关崇徽公主手迹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一拓纤痕更不收，翠微苍藓几经秋。\n谁陈帝子和番策，我是男儿爲国羞。\n寒雨洗来香已尽，澹烟笼着恨长留。\n可怜汾水知人意，旁与吞声未忍休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}